The certificate authorities the Xbox's self-updater checks servers against
(port/xbox/src/nxdk_update.c, built into the program: an Xbox has no store of
its own). GitHub's API and pages chain to USERTrust ECC; its release
downloads to ISRG Root X1 (Let's Encrypt); the rest are there for when they
change. Taken from the Mozilla root program's bundle (macOS /etc/ssl/cert.pem),
by name, and checked by SHA-256 fingerprint. Text outside the certificates is
ignored by the parser.

